CM_ BO_ 1025 "CAN1 RX mailbox slot 0, hardware MB1. Cell 1-4, little-endian uint16, 1 mV/bit.";
CM_ BO_ 1026 "CAN1 RX mailbox slot 1, hardware MB2. Cell 5-8, little-endian uint16, 1 mV/bit.";
CM_ BO_ 1027 "CAN1 RX mailbox slot 2, hardware MB3. Cell 9-12, little-endian uint16, 1 mV/bit.";
CM_ BO_ 1028 "CAN1 RX mailbox slot 3, hardware MB4. Cell 13-16, little-endian uint16, 1 mV/bit.";
CM_ BO_ 1040 "CAN2 ADBMS2950 current frame. Signal layout is not defined by the supplied Bms_Can/Bms_Vafe sources.";
